([P1] A choir of twenty-eight pupils from a village school in Vanir has won a) Tj
T*
(national singing contest for the first time. The group performed two pieces,) Tj
T*
(including a lullaby arranged by their music teacher.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] Judges said the choir was chosen for its clear diction and careful) Tj
T*
(dynamics. The pupils travelled to the final by bus with parents and teachers,) Tj
T*
(and returned home late in the evening to a small celebration at the school.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
